  "zh": "# APEC深圳峰会引领外交，华为超薄表、宁德催款、闪存降价、Gemini模型齐发。\n## 地缘政治与外交\n- **中美元首深圳会晤**：习近平与特朗普在APEC期间会面，释放中美关系缓和信号，市场密切关注后续经贸谈判走向。\n- **中俄美元首座驾首次同框**：三国领导人车队同框罕见，象征多极外交新图景，地缘博弈微妙升级。\n## 科技产业与消费电子\n- **华为将发布首款超薄智能手表**：华为进军高端穿戴新品，主打极薄设计与健康监测，能否撼动Apple Watch成焦点。\n- **宁德时代向理想汽车发三封催款函**：电池龙头与车企因供货款纠纷公开对峙，供应链博弈白热化。\n- **闪存价格两周下跌20%**：存储芯价格跳水传导至终端成本，手机、SSD厂商或迎利润窗口。\n## AI 与前沿科技\n- **Gemini 4 Neon发布**：Google新一代多模态大模型主打推理与代码能力，直接对标OpenAI最新模型。\n- **AI Agents审计超越KPMG**：自主提问能力展示AI替代专业服务雏形，企业级落地提速。\n- **中南大学通报附属医院AI论文争议**：学术界首次因AI生成内容引发调查，折射科研诚信新挑战。",
  "en": "# APEC Shenzhen summit drives diplomacy; Huawei ultra-thin watch, CATL demands payment, flash prices plunge, Gemini model launches.\n## Geopolitics & Diplomacy\n- **Xi-Trump Shenzhen Summit**：Xi and Trump meet at APEC, signaling a thaw in US-China ties; markets watch for trade follow-up.\n- **China-Russia-US Motorcades Share Frame**：Rare three-leader motorcade appearance underscores shifting multipolar diplomacy.\n## Tech & Consumer Electronics\n- **Huawei Launches Ultra-Thin Smartwatch**：Huawei enters premium wearables with an ultra-thin health-focused watch, challenging Apple Watch dominance.\n- **CATL Sends Three Demand Letters to Li Auto**：Battery giant publicly presses EV maker over unpaid supplies, highlighting supply-chain tensions.\n- **Flash Memory Prices Drop 20% in Two Weeks**：NAND price plunge trickles down to device makers, potentially boosting margins for phones and SSDs.\n## AI & Frontier Tech\n- **Gemini 4 Neon Released**：Google's next-gen multimodal model emphasizes reasoning and coding, positioned as direct rival to OpenAI's latest.\n- **AI Agents Outperform KPMG Auditors**：Autonomous questioning ability shows AI encroaching on professional services, accelerating enterprise adoption.\n- **Central South University Probes Hospital AI Paper**：First academic probe into AI-generated content raises research integrity concerns."
